    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. one last thing—can you mention how these scaling methods handle \"unseen\" or unpredictable issues? like, when something goes wrong that we didn't plan for in the code or the config, which method gives us more breathing room to troubleshoot without everything just crashing immediately? just want to wrap it up with a note on stability.",
